<title>SRI LANKA: Development Finance 9-mth net dips 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Development Finance 9-mth net dips 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Development Finance Corporation of Ceylon Ltd for the nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Income	   1,690.00   vs	 1,512.00</p>
<p>     Net profit	 268.00   vs	   353.00</p>
<p>     Tax provision    123.00   vs	   120.00</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Development Finance Corporation is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
